     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nthis may be interesting to some on these lists.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  -- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4704...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4704...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Brady Mattsson &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brady.m...@boku.ac.at</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, June 2, 2023 14:59<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Eva Maria Schöll &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eva.s...@boku.ac.at</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Postdoc position in Vienna -- modeling wind farm effects</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><span>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello everyone,</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">My colleague Eva Schöll is seeking a postdoc to fit spatially explicit models (e.g. occupancy) to datasets on birds and mammals to examine effects of wind farms on wildlife populations and communities across the EU.  Please see the announcement\r\n below, and let her know if you have any questions about it.  The deadline is June 30th.</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"https://boku.ac.at/fileadmin/data/H01000/mitteilungsblatt-jobs/2023/KZ79_mD_DMe.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://boku.ac.at/fileadmin/data/H01000/mitteilungsblatt-jobs/2023/KZ79_mD_DMe.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448926007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0JQ3JsddlpROk8zxTyjaZ4\">https://boku.ac.at/fileadmin/data/H01000/mitteilungsblatt-jobs/2023/KZ79_mD_DMe.pdf</a><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>Brady Mattsson</div>\r\n<div>Institute of Wildlife Biology and Game Management<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>University of Natural Resources and Life Sciences, Vienna (BOKU)</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Gregor-Mendel-Straße 33</div>\r\n<div>1180 Vienna, Austria</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:arial,verdana,helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">E-mail: </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brady.m...@boku.ac.at</a><span style=\"font-family:arial,verdana,helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://www.boku.ac.at/en/personen/person/E0CBBD47B7286435/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.boku.ac.at/en/personen/person/E0CBBD47B7286435/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448926007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wAaAuePJme5Y-NmYhcb9h\">short.boku.ac.at/mattsson.html</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><br>\r\n<u></u></span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">there is a vacancy for a <b>fully-funded Postdoctoral Research Associate</b> at the Department of Integrative Biology and Biodiversity Research, University of Natural Resources and Life Sciences Vienna (BOKU).<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Postdoctoral Research Associate will work in an international multidisciplinary team and be responsible for the development of high-resolution, spatial explicit models for selected wildlife species. <span lang=\"EN-US\">The full job\r\n description is attached to this email.</span></span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">The job application should be sent to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kerstin.b...@boku.ac.at</a>. <b>Deadline is June 30<sup>th </sup>2023.<u></u><u></u></b></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">Please feel free to share our job announcement with your colleagues or on your platforms.<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">Best regards,<u></u><u></u></span></div>\r\n<div><span lang=\"EN-US\">Eva Schöll<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<span style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-bottom:5px;display:block\"><span style=\"display:block\"><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt;display:inline-block\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma, sans-serif\">\r\n<div><span>\r\n<div><strong><font face=\"Arial\">Dr. Eva Schöll, MSc.<font face=\"Arial\"><br>\r\n</font></font></strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><font face=\"Arial\"><strong>Universität für Bodenkultur Wien (BOKU)</strong></font></font></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">University of Natural Resources and Life Sciences, Vienna</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><span>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Department für Integrative Biologie und Biodiversitätsforschung</font></div>\r\n</span><font face=\"Arial\">Institut für Wildbiologie und Jagdwirtschaft</font></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Gregor-Mendel-Straße 33, 1180 Wien</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Telefon: <a href=\"tel:+43%201%204765483221\" value=\"+4314765483221\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+43 1 47654-83221</a></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">E-Mail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eva.s...@boku.ac.at</a></font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial\">Website: <a href=\"https://www.boku.ac.at/iwj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.boku.ac.at/iwj&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448926007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EjQrk14M5mF1tsea8IfJn\">https://www.boku.ac.at/iwj</a><a href=\"htt